{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_17_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_17","textTraditional":"一、六年，春正月，寔來。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_17_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_17","textTraditional":"寔來者何？猶曰是人來也。孰謂？謂州公也。曷為謂之寔來？慢之也。曷為慢之？化我也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_17_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_17","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，公會紀侯于成。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_17_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_17","textTraditional":"三、秋，八月壬午，大閱。蔡人殺陳佗。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_17_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_17","textTraditional":"大閱者何？簡車徒也。何以書？蓋以罕書也。陳佗者何？陳君也。陳君則曷為謂之陳佗？絕也。曷為絕之？賤也。其賤奈何？外淫也。惡乎淫？淫于蔡，蔡人殺之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_17_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_17","textTraditional":"四、九月丁卯，子同生。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_17_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_17","textTraditional":"子同生者孰謂？謂莊公也。何言乎子同生？喜有正也。未有言喜有正者，此其言喜有正何？久無正也。子公羊子曰：「其諸以病桓與？」","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_17_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_17","textTraditional":"五、冬，紀侯來朝。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}